---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | The Cosy Canvas Co."
  description="Privacy Policy and GDPR compliance details for The Cosy Canvas Co. customers in Scotland and the UK."
>
  <div class="bg-[#111111] text-white py-12 md:py-16 border-b border-stone-800 relative z-30">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
      <h1 class="font-display text-3xl md:text-4xl font-black text-white">
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>
      <p class="text-stone-400 text-xs sm:text-sm mt-2">Last updated: March 2026</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="py-16 bg-stone-50/60">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 bg-white p-8 md:p-12 rounded-3xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed space-y-6">
      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-base text-[#111111] mb-2">1. Data Collection & Processing</h2>
        <p>The Cosy Canvas Co. collects essential personal information including your name, email address, phone number, billing address, and campsite destination solely to manage your bell tent hire reservation, process secure payments, and coordinate delivery.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-base text-[#111111] mb-2">2. Payment Security</h2>
        <p>All card payments and security deposit authorizations are processed securely via Stripe using 256-bit SSL encryption. We never store or view raw debit or credit card details on our servers.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-base text-[#111111] mb-2">3. Third-Party Services</h2>
        <p>We do not sell, trade, or rent your personal information to third parties. Data is only shared with trusted service providers directly involved in completing your booking (e.g. Stripe for payments, Resend for transactional email receipts).</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-base text-[#111111] mb-2">4. Your Rights (GDPR & UK DPA)</h2>
        <p>Under the UK Data Protection Act and GDPR, you have the right to request a copy of the personal data we hold about you or request its deletion at any time by contacting <a href="mailto:hello@cosycanvasco.com" class="text-[#7D6E23] underline font-bold">hello@cosycanvasco.com</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
